0.25 w BT/F4 12 Tf0 Tc 0 Tw 108.125 662.5 TD (DNACode User Guide)Tj/F4 10 Tf173.613 -530.75 TD (viii)Tj/F7 14 Tf-173.613 498 TD (2. Bio-Rad Listens)Tj/F6 10 Tf18 -21.5 TD (The staff at Bio-Rad are receptive to your suggestions. Many of the new )Tj0 -12 TD (features and enhancements in this version of DNACode are a direct result of )TjT* -0.18 Tw (conversations with our customers. Please let us know what you would like to )TjT* 0 Tw (see in the next version of DNACode by faxing, calling, or e-mailing our )TjT* -0.029 Tc (Technical Services staff. You can also use Solobug \(installed with DNACode\) )TjT* 0 Tc (to make software feature requests.)TjETendstreamendobj45 0 obj671endobj43 0 obj<</Type /Page/Parent 38 0 R/Resources <</Font <</F4 16 0 R /F6 20 0 R /F7 25 0 R >>/ProcSet 2 0 R>>/Contents 44 0 R>>endobj47 0 obj<</Length 48 0 R>>stream
0.25 w BT/F4 10 Tf0 Tc 0 Tw 316.901 131.75 TD [ (1-)1 (1)] TJ/F7 24 Tf-172.776 491.25 TD (1. Introduction)Tj/F7 14 Tf0 -45.25 TD (1.1. A Brief Overview of DNACode)Tj/F6 10 Tf18 -21.5 TD (DNACode\252 is a software package for analyzing DNA sequencing gels that )Tj0 -12 TD (have been sequenced using the enzymatic method developed by Sanger et )TjT* (al.)Tj/F6 8 Tf10.408 4 TD (1)Tj/F6 10 Tf4 -4 TD ( )Tj-14.408 -20 TD -0.015 Tc (The software runs in a Windows or Macintosh environment and has an easy-)Tj0 -12 TD 0 Tc (to-use interface with standard pull-down menus, toolbars, and keyboard )TjT* (commands.)Tj0 -20 TD (An image of a gel is captured using the controls in the imaging device )Tj0 -12 TD (window and displayed on your computer monitor. Image processing and )TjT* (analysis operations are performed using commands from the menus and )TjT* (toolbars.)Tj0 -20 TD (Images can be magni\336ed, annotated, rotated, and resized. They can be )Tj0 -12 TD (printed using standard and video printers.)Tj0 -20 TD (DNACode has robust algorithms that can read the sequence from gels with )Tj0 -12 TD (many lanesets, each containing hundreds of bases. The software can cope )TjT* (with distortions in both lane and band shape. Lanes can be adjusted along )TjT* (their lengths to compensate for any curvature or smiling of gels.)Tj0 -20 TD -0.019 Tc (You can share your  images among all the Discovery Series\252 software, or )Tj0 -12 TD 0 Tc (convert them into TIFF format for compatibility with other Macintosh and )TjT* (Windows applications.)Tj/F7 14 Tf-18 -38.5 TD (1.2. Digital Data and Signal Intensity)Tj/F6 10 Tf18 -21.5 TD (The Bio-Rad imaging devices supported by DNACode are light and/or )Tj0 -12 TD (radiation detectors that convert signals from biological samples into digital )TjT* (data. DNACode then displays the digital data on your computer screen, in )TjT* (the form of gray scale or color images.)TjET152.75 195.75 0.25 0.5 ref 297 195.75 0.25 0.5 ref 153 195.75 144 0.5 ref BT/F10 10 Tf162.125 176.25 TD (1.)Tj12 0 TD -0.017 Tc (Sanger F and Coulson A R. 1977. Proc Natl Acad Sci. USA, 74, 5436.)TjETendstreamendobj48 0 obj2170endobj46 0 obj<</Type /Page/Parent 38 0 R/Resources <</Font <</F4 16 0 R /F6 20 0 R /F7 25 0 R /F10 49 0 R >>/ProcSet 2 0 R>>/Contents 47 0 R>>endobj52 0 obj<</Length 53 0 R>>stream
